Package: microsandbox-bin
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: boxd maintainers <gsalucci@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: libc6
Homepage: https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox
Description: microsandbox: small virtual machines on kvm (prebuilt release)
 Repack of the pinned official microsandbox release (msb and libkrunfw side by
 side under /usr/lib/microsandbox/<version>/, link /usr/bin/msb). boxd-setup
 installs it where /dev/kvm and processor virtualization exist.
